  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "Native Svt listener M:N registration, default shallow declaration copy, CopyAllBroadcasters self-clear and reciprocal copy; broadcaster copies original listeners reciprocally. Snapshot membership retains ordinary removed listeners for current dispatch; normalized allocation-identity pointer ordering and tombstone slot reuse preserve original references.",
    "PrepareForDestruction only announces destruction. Explicit JS Dispose broadcasts Dying and unregisters original listeners, skipping prepared removals. Packed pointer bits, actual C++ addresses, partial-sort/cache performance, mutable vector and debug assertions remain unverified browser boundaries.",
    "BroadcasterMixin composition and BroadcastingModify deliver Writer clients first and original exact hints to separate Svt observers. Existing browser transaction terminal flush delivers one original accepted batch; this adaptation is explicit. HasWriterListeners stays independent of Svt registrations; native last-writer row/cell/history cleanup deletes original formats.",
    "SwFormat derives from BroadcastingModify and removes NotifyAttributeSet and all generic attribute device bridge calls. Browser native observer receives actual original style/table/row/cell notifiers and original replacement hints, invalidating native root and Sfx bindings without document writes or TextRuns conversion; final structure/history/replacement invalidations reconcile actual sources. Silent raw ClaimFrameFormat without document invalidation and full native physical-client layout integration remain unverified.",
    "Exactly one old device contract migrates to original notifier/order/lock/no-document-signal semantics while preserving native attribute/identity/equality assertions.662other prior acceptance files byte-identical,3fresh files,666total;318old metadata fields/status/default/classification/order/evidence retained,3new unverified records321total.",
    "Unique1596app cases including18fresh and13Chromium pass upstream physically absent/restored finally. No unchanged passing replays. Actual all-four100 app318files/inventory38files with whole byte-identical source/maps or complete unchanged native declaration/body/enclosing branch/location transfer. Full cadence last237,next247; broad goal incomplete."
  ]
